===Etymology===
[[File:Tractus intestinalis duodenum.svg|thumb|A schematic of the [[gastrointestinal tract]], with the duodenum shown in orange-pink]]

From {{der|en|ML.|[[duodēnum]] [[digitōrum]]||space of [[twelve]] [[digit]]s}} in reference to its length, from {{m|la|duodeni|duodēnī|twelve each}} + {{m|la|digitōrum}}, [[Appendix:Glossary#genitive case|genitive]] [[Appendix:Glossary#plural number|plural]] of {{m|la|digitus||[[finger#Noun|finger]]; [[toe]]; digit}}.

